        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 6655, Traditional Mansion Dummy Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in satin nickel or black finishes, the Weslock Mansion Dummy Handleset features graceful arched plates. The beveled edges paired with the curved handle are a picture of elegance and subtle beauty. No matter which of the finishes you choose, the Mansion handleset will add a touch of simple richness to your doors. The Arched Mansion Dummy Handleset is just for looks; it neither latches nor locks. Dummy handlesets are most often used as a pull or on the inactive side of double doors to match the existing trim. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset does not function--neither locking nor latching.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/arched-mansion-single-cylinder-handleset-weslock-6651-6600\"><b>Mansion Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis traditional handleset is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-elegance-collection\"><b>Weslock Elegance Collection</b></a> which features lifetime finish and mechanical warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Arched Mansion Dummy Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: solid brass</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited 10 Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Elegance Collection Arched Mansion Dummy Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Length: 10-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
